=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ VLMF @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt VLMF @VERSION@ for OpenVMS (vms-vlmf): full-screen license manager, early test
1 'NOTICE
=prompt VLMF is distributed under the MIT licence. This is an early test release.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [VLMF]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for VLMF (vms-vlmf)
    At boot, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:VLMF$STARTUP.COM
    For users, in SYS$MANAGER:SYLOGIN.COM or a LOGIN.COM:
    $ VLMF :== $VLMF:VLMF.EXE

PRODUCT REMOVE VLMF deassigns VLMF$ROOT and VLMF. The license database,
VLMF's backup copies and logs in users' SYS$LOGIN are not touched.
